WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:03.020
The first soft landing anyone can find.

00:03.720 --> 00:05.235
It was not the first.

00:05.685 --> 00:20.363
The Soviet Luna 9 landed softly four months earlier, on 3 February 1966, but NASA's table says the place published for it is probably at least 10 km out, direction unknown.

00:20.813 --> 00:26.805
Surveyor 1 shut off its engines 3.4 m up and dropped the rest of the way.
